Carl M Kadie (kadie@cs.uiuc.edu) wrote:
: I notice that the U. of Bergen now runs a Veronica server. This means
: the university is providing direct pointers to all kinds of gopher
: materials from all over the world.

: If direct pointers to offensive material is improper, the U. of Bergen
