From caf-talk Caf May  9 15:33:15 1994
From: kadie@eff.org (Carl M. Kadie)
Newsgroups: comp.admin.policy,alt.comp.acad-freedom.talk,no.general
Subject: Re: A university in Norway bans references to offensive material????
Date: 9 May 1994 15:33:14 -0400
