Of course they aren't.  But that doesn't change the fact that one doesn't
need news to do one's university researcher or student job.  We got on quite
well without interaction for thousands of years.  Unless you can prove to
the powers that be at your university that interaction in news form is
absolutely vital to your research, why bother keeping it?  By transitive
